+        ``tie_word_embeddings=True``, while Janus' nested ``LlamaConfig`` uses
+        ``False``. Delegating here prevents CPU-efficient FSDP loading from
+        temporarily aliasing the distinct input embedding and LM head.
+        """
+        return self.language_model.tie_weights()
+
